        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86621, Riviera Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Riviera Appliance Pull is available in a 12 inch and an 18 inch size. Choose from modern finish color options. The Riviera Refrigerator Pull has a unique style that is stunning. This fridge pull is part of a collection by Emtek which features transitional styling. The Emtek Riviera Refrigerator Handle will fit a 3/4 inch appliance panel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Riviera Refrigerator Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86621:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86622:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
